  "conclusion": "Geoffrey Bawa’s Parliament Building remains the meeting place of Sri Lanka’s national legislature at Sri Jayawardenepura Kotte. Lunuganga is maintained as a garden and architectural site by the Geoffrey Bawa and Lunuganga Trusts. The Bentota Beach Hotel, Heritance Kandalama, and Lighthouse Hotel continue to receive guests. Bawa influenced a generation of architects in Sri Lanka, and his work has been embraced across Asia and beyond.",
